{"SurveyID":"SV_0VWzM3BBCq9ZT8i","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID15","SecondaryAttribute":"Remote treatment The Cumberree Mountain range is a remote mountain range renowned for its beauty...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<b>Remote treatment<\/b><br><br>\n\n\n\nThe Cumberree Mountain range is a remote mountain range renowned for its beauty and clean air. It hosts a hospital specialized for treating Pink Flu, a deadly disease requiring continuous medical care, but from which patients usually recover. The mountain range also hosts a village dedicated to holding arts festivals.\n\n<br>\n\nAn earthquake struck the village, and the survivors require immediate medical attention. However, the only medical personnel available are from the Pink Flu hospital, whose patients will die if staff is withdrawn to attend to the earthquake victims.\n\n<br>\n\nYou are the head of the Pink Flu hospital. If you move your team to attend to the earthquake victims, you will save 12,000 earthquake survivors, but your 20 Pink Flu patients will die a painful death, <b>feel like third degree burns across the body and slowly asphyxiate<\/b>.\n\n<br><br>\n\n","DataExportTag":"scenario.remoteTreatment.vivid.n_saved.12000.n_total.12020.n_victims.20","QuestionID":"QID15","QuestionType":"Matrix","Selector":"Likert","SubSelector":"SingleAnswer","QuestionDescription":"Remote treatment The Cumberree Mountain range is a remote mountain range renowned for its beauty...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"<p style=\"min-width:350px;\"> How horrific would the death of the people in the village be for each of the affected persons? <br><\/p>"},"2":{"Display":"<p style=\"min-width:350px;\"> How horrific would the death of the Pink Flu patients be for each of the affected persons? <br><\/p>"},"3":{"Display":"<p style=\"min-width:350px;\"> How acceptable is it to kill these 20 patients to save 12,000 earthquake survivors? <br><\/p>"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Ty